{#- #838, 28 Sep 2026; logos and one page per card, #841, 29 Sep 2026. The
    nine tiles the studio's own *Connect your apps* grid holds (`APPS` in the
    studio's public/studio.js), one card each, in the studio's order: the five
    that work, the one that is coming, then the three doors into an agent.
    Shared by /integrations/ (all nine) and by every integration page (the
    other eight, under *More integrations*): set `skipApp` before including
    to leave one out.

    Every sentence here is what the studio's help says a connection does
    (docs/help/08-workspace.md, 12-connect-your-claude.md), one line each.

    The marks are the vendors' own (#841, the operator's call over #572's
    monograms): Close's from close.com's own header logo, Affinity's and
    Lightfield's from their own sites, Reevo's from reevo.ai's header, Attio's
    from attio.com's header wordmark, HighLevel's from its own brand kit (#1045), HubSpot's, Slack's, Salesforce's,
    Claude's and OpenAI's as the Simple Icons project carries them (CC0),
    each in the vendor's own colour and never redrawn. The vendor's name is
    never translated; a category is, in the studio's words. Nominative use;
    what a vendor's brand terms ask beyond that is #572's row.

    Written as markup rather than as a data file because the translation
    inventory reads `{% t %}` blocks and frontmatter `faqs:`, not a list in a
    data file (lib/i18n.js): a sentence in a data file could be translated
    and the catalogue entry would read as stale. -#}
{#- The card names are h3 under an integration page's "More integrations" h2,
    and h2 on /integrations/, where nothing sits between them and the h1
    (weekly SEO pass, 12 Oct 2026: the audit reported h1 to h3). Set
    `cardLevel` before including to change it. -#}
{%- set cardH = cardLevel or 'h3' %}
<ul class="card-grid int-grid">
  {%- if skipApp != 'close' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/close/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/close.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Close</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}A finished pitch lands as a lead, its contacts, an opportunity and a note. Push again and the same records update.{% endt %}</p>
      {%- if offer.close %}
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}One month free for Close users →{% endt %}</span>
      {%- else %}
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
      {%- endif %}
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'hubspot' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/hubspot/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/hubspot.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">HubSpot</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}A Company, its Contacts, a Deal in your first stage and a Note. Connect with one button, or paste a private app token.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'affinity' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/affinity/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/affinity.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Affinity</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}The organization on the list you pick, its people and a note. Paste an API key and press Connect.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'lightfield' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/lightfield/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/lightfield.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Lightfield</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}An account, the contacts with a work email, an opportunity and a note. Paste a key and press Connect.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {#- Reevo, Attio and HighLevel (#1045), each with its own page since #1046. -#}
  {%- if skipApp != 'reevo' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/reevo/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/reevo.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Reevo</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}An account, the contacts with a work email, an opportunity and an activity saying why. Paste a key and press Connect.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'attio' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/attio/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/attio.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Attio</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}A company, the people with a work email and a dated note. Paste an access token and press Connect.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'highlevel' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/highlevel/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/highlevel.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">HighLevel</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}A contact for each person with a work email, tagged prospektor, and a note. Paste a token and your Location ID.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  <li class="card int-card is-static">
    <div class="card-body">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/salesforce.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}CRM{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Salesforce</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}Next in line. Say so under Request an integration in your workspace settings and it moves up.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}Soon{% endt %}</span>
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- if skipApp != 'slack' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/slack/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/slack.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}Team chat{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Slack</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}Every finished pitch posts one short message where the team already is: company, fit score, the angle, a link back.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'claude' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/claude/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/claude.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}AI assistant{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">Claude</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}Your own Claude does the work here: reads a company, writes the pitch, preps the call. One connector address in claude.ai, a token in Claude Code, Desktop or Cursor.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'chatgpt' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/chatgpt/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark has-logo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/chatgpt.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}AI assistant{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">ChatGPT</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}Add one connector address in ChatGPT and it reads a company, writes the pitch and records what happened. There is no token to paste.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if skipApp != 'agent' %}
  <li class="card int-card">
    <a href="{{ '/integrations/your-own-agent/' | localize }}">
      <span class="int-mark" aria-hidden="true">{}</span>
      <span class="card-topic">{% t %}API token{% endt %}</span>
      <{{ cardH }} class="card-title">{% t %}Your own agent{% endt %}</{{ cardH }}>
      <p class="card-dek">{% t %}A token lets a script, an agent or your CRM call the workspace. Tick what it may do and when it expires; the secret is shown once.{% endt %}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">{% t %}How it works →{% endt %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
</ul>
